# SpaceBook: what the folder shows when no file name is given, and no directory listings.
# Uploaded by the deploy workflow with the rest of the site (the server did not pick index.html by itself: /spacebook/ showed a file list).
# Headers, caching and the report-only Content-Security-Policy are in deploy/spacebook.htaccess; the owner installs those by hand (docs/SERVER_CONFIG.md).
DirectoryIndex index.html
Options -Indexes
